{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3081","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3081","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3081\",\"parent_revision\":\"0cc8e7c9eb032d22ff9e88789136d71fcb4d58a774e4d669bdc9f5fdbd1f223b\",\"root_revision\":\"0cc8e7c9eb032d22ff9e88789136d71fcb4d58a774e4d669bdc9f5fdbd1f223b\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nNamed as a known gap in ADR-3075-4, not solved there. `CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID` is shared not\\nonly across one agent's own MCP-vs-CLI calls, but across every subagent this repo's\\n`TeamCreate`/parallel-`Agent()` patterns spawn within that session \u2014 they inherit the same\\nsession ID. A parallel review team all viewing or grooming the same item can therefore perform\\na concurrent read-modify-write against the same session-keyed control-set store.\\n\\n`get-gate-token.mjs` (the precedent ADR-3075-4 follows for session-keyed storage) is not\\nprecedent for this: it performs one atomic `writeFileSync` of a single value, never a keyed\\nread-modify-write, and has nothing analogous to write-triggered invalidation (#3079) racing a\\nconcurrent requery.\\n\\n## Dependencies\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nBlocked on #3062 (control set must exist first) and ADR-3075-4 (out-of-process, session-keyed\\nstore \u2014 the design this concurrency hazard is specific to).\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] A locking or coordination scheme prevents a concurrent write-invalidation and requery\\n      against the same control-set entry from producing a corrupted or inconsistent entry\\n- [ ] Concurrent reads of different entries in the same session-keyed store are not serialized\\n      by whatever mechanism solves the above (no unnecessary contention across unrelated\\n      entries)\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"210737fa37cfe93d39578be94b219bde329125814dcecb70d014c0c42d168cca\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPvb2-w\"}"}